<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - DLJ ups Hewlett-Packard.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - DLJ ups Hewlett-Packard.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Donaldson Lufkin analyst Tom Rooney raised Hewlett-Packard Co to buy from market perform, a source at the brokerage said.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not available to comment.</p>
</text>
